OL,3,GNEWSABrain implant centre gets #6m     
OL,4,Afunding to grow                        
OL,6,FThe UK's first centre dedicated to     
OL,7,Fadvancing pioneering brain implant     
OL,8,Ftechnology has secured more than #6m to
OL,9,Fexpand treatments.                     
OL,11,FThe National Centre for Neurotechnology
OL,12,Fand Neurorestoration (NCNN) in         
OL,13,FNewcastle uses brain and nervous system
OL,14,Ftechnologies to help treat patients    
OL,15,Fwith conditions including Parkinson's  
OL,16,Fdisease, paralysis and severe pain.    
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
