OL,3,GNEWSABrain implant centre gets #6m     
OL,4,Afunding to grow                        
OL,6,FDirector Akbar Hussain said it had     
OL,7,Falready delivered "some amazing        
OL,8,Fsuccesses", while scientist Dr Luke    
OL,9,FBashford said the investment would     
OL,10,Fallow the centre to "scale up" their   
OL,11,Fwork.                                  
OL,13,FThe Advanced Research and Invention    
OL,14,FAgency (ARIA) has paid #3.1m in        
OL,15,Ffunding, matched by Newcastle upon Tyne
OL,16,FHospitals NHS Foundation Trust and     
OL,17,FNewcastle University.                  
